00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:36.030
Motto To LOVE-Ru 07

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:36.030
<u>Special Love Medicine</u>

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:38.950
Yuuki-kun. You're on duty today, right?

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.450
Yeah.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.620
Can you take these printouts to Kotegawa-kun?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.950
She's taken the day off because she's sick.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.960
Her address is inside.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.420
Alright.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.210
How unusual for Kotegawa to take a day off...

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.600
It looks like my fever has gone down.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.560
If I don't get better soon, I'll fall behind in my studies. {TLC}

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:16.320
Hey. I've brought your food and medicine.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.650
Thanks.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.490
Onii-chan, what about university?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:21.740
Ah, I'm not going today.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.780
Why?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.330
My cute little sister isn't feeling well. {"Kurushii" TLC}

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.080
How could I possibly go to school?

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:33.170
That won't make a good excuse for skipping school, you know.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.630
Oh, shut up.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.760
When you're finished, put the plate out in the corridor.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:37.590
I'll come and get it.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.510
Has Mum gone out?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.100
She's gone out shopping in the neighbourhood.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:45.180
Did you need something?

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.560
No. Not really.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.980
Alright then.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:57.740
I was going to ask Mum to help me wash myself... {TLC}{I'LL HELP OUT -masat}

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.670
Coming!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.670
Even though I was asked to come as a favour,

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:18.010
still, it's nerve wrecking to come to a girl's house!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.340
Huh?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.090
W-Well...

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:25.180
I've come to give Kotegawa Yui-san her printouts.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.640
Oh! Sorry for the trouble.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.470
I'll give them to you now.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.440
Hey. Why don't you come in and give them to her?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.400
Ah, but-{just "But" would be too short so I altered it a bit -masat}

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.520
It's fine.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.860
This way, Yui would be happy.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.110
Right...

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.160
Um... Kotegawa?

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.920
T-This is... Y-Your brother...

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.550
How shameless!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.300
Why are you here, Yuuki-kun?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.680
Your brother let me in.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.060
Even so...

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.810
Coming into a girl's room without even knocking...

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.270
How rude! {TLC: Rude? Mannerless? Not sure here.}

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.520
Sorry.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.400
Jeez...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.860
So, what did you want?

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:25.870
A Class representative told me to bring you these. {TLC: He was told by "class-iin" but i don't know what how to TL that. Haruna is the class-rep anyway.}{Haruna isn't the only class representative it seems. It's either committee member or representative. Your pick}

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:29.950
Thanks.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.420
So... How are you feeling?{How are you feeling?}

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.000
My fever's gone down.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.380
I'm thinking about returning to school tomorrow. {Editor: thinking about? feel like? }

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.760
I see. That's good to hear.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.110
Even though he was told to come as a favour...

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.940
But for Yuuki-kun to actually come to my house... {TLC}

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:08.660
Being alone with a girl in her room is making me strangely nervous! {TLC}

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.240
I... I need to start talking about something.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.710
He's looking around my room!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.170
Oh no! It's kinda embarrassing!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.380
I don't have any weird stuff lying around, right?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.420
Kotegawa.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:25.880
What is it?!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.760
You...

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.140
What a serious expression.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.360
Perhaps you like cats?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.320
Yeah, anything wrong with that?

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.870
Well no; it was rather surprising, that's all.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.540
Give that back to me!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.920
Are you alright, Kotegawa?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.310
Hey. I brought you some coffee-

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.480
My bad!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.560
What are you misunderstanding?! {Editor: "What are you getting the wrong idea of?" etc}{WHY DOES HE STILL HAVE HIS HAND THERE? -masat}{I'd leave my hand there for a few more seconds, too. -Holo}

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.480
That surprised me. {TLC}

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.740
Who would've thought that Yui has gone so far already. {TLC}{oh just wait until the next scene when she takes a shower and he accidentally enters -masat}

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.490
I was too careless.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.290
Sorry.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.790
Don't worry about it. It was my fault anyway.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.130
I should be heading back soon.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.720
If I stay here any longer, I'll get in the way of your recovery. {TLC/Edit: (To disturb/be in the way of) her (resting time/recovery)}

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.600
Of course not...

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.980
My fever... has already gone.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.350
N-Nothing!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.320
Hey! You've got more guests!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.610
Hello!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.530
I brought everyone along to see how you're doing!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.990
Eh? Rito is already here?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.700
Yeah. Something came up. {TLC - I'm not sure here.}

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.160
You sure it's just something? {TLC - I'm sure she says more stuff here}

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.500
Of course.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.750
How suspicious...

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.370
What is? {overlap}{if these have to be on the bottom hand, split the next line at the scene change -masat}

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.830
Thank goodness! You look well, Kotegawa-san.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.170
Taiyaki for you. {TLC - not sure what that is}

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.510
Thanks.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.630
There are so many cats here!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.010
Eh?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.390
Hey Yui! Perhaps you like cats?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.810
Well... That's...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:43.350
I've brought over a lot of medicine from Mikado-sensei!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.150
Thanks.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.770
I think I'll pass on that.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.860
There really is so much here! {refering to medicine I assume}

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:52.490
I told Mikado-sensei that you caught a cold, and she gave me all this to bring to you!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.660
Haruna, check this out!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.950
Thanks, everyone.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.740
But...{added this -masat}

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.790
What would have happened if the two of us were left alone a little longer?{dang, I guess that shower scene won't happen for now -masat}

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.380
How shameless!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.390
Hey, Lala!

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:22.350
Motto To LOVE-Ru 08

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:22.350
<u>Seeing you through the lens...</u>

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.480
We're gonna be late for school!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.560
Eh?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.440
It doesn't look like she's here.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.780
Is this Lala's?

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.370
What a weird pair of glasses.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.490
Rito, I'm coming in!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.000
Geez, you really haven't taken it out yet.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.550
Didn't I tell you that the combustible trash is getting collected today?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.760
The combustible trash needs to be taken out of the bin.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.430
What are you doing in those clothes?

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.680
Eh? Something wrong?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.600
They're normal, like always. {Edit}

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.350
Normal?

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.940
Ah, I'm on duty today.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.110
I'll head off to school first.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.490
Even if it's summer...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.610
Is this what they call "going through a difficult phase"? {TLC please lol}

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.380
There isn't enough time, so for now, I'll have to wear it to school.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:32.500
If Lala is already at school, then maybe she can help me take them off.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:38.010
Worst case, I'll have to wear them the entire day. {TLC, Guessed}

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.060
I definitely feel my clothes...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.940
Maybe it's because of these glasses?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.860
Oh, it's Yuuki!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.030
Good morning!

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.450
What's up with those glasses?

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.530
They don't suit you at all!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.410
Black! {fail censoring -nt}

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.080
What did you say?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.740
{Um...}Ah no, it's just-{TLCed ;) -masat}

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.500
Good morning, Yuuki-kun!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.910
Sairenji!?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.500
You're not with Lala-san?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.340
I didn't see it!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.880
I didn't see anything!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.510
What's the matter, Yuuki-kun?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.800
Maybe he had dirty dreams about you last night.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.760
Eh? What are you saying?!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.490
That Lala...

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.610
Why would she invent something like this?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:41.490
And she's not even at school yet!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.370
What am I going to do?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.740
Rito-kun!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.250
Hey, can you listen to me for a sec?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.710
W-What?

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.880
W-Well... I've had a headache all morning...

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:54.920
Are you alright?

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.260
It's not that bad...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.010
Anyway, you had something to say...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:04.260
Actually, from today on, I'll be a student in this class!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.100
Eh?

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.310
Run-chan... {Overlap}

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.890
I want to get closer to you, so I asked the Principal for permission.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.810
Same class? {Overlap}

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:14.820
I sang some new songs for him and he approved it right away.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.900
This school is so simple... {she's also fugly... if there's such a thing in anime -nt}

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.490
From now on, we'll be together forever!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:23.910
Well, sometimes my idol work will prevent me from coming to school...

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.620
By the way, what's up with those glasses?

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.580
Eh? T-These are Lala's glasses.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.910
So Lala-chan gave you those...

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:36.960
I don't think they suit you though, Rito-kun.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.260
Rito-kun?

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.380
Oh no! This is really bad!

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.140
Now I can totally see them naked!!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.220
Ah! Zastin-sama!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.930
What's the matter?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.440
Love is like a rabbit in a field.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.230
You go chasing after it no matter where it takes you. {TLC}

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.230
Saki-sama...

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.280
It's like a little bird trying to fly into the sky... {TLC}

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.360
Why... {TLC}

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.580
Ow...

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.830
What going on? {faaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaail faaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaail censoing! -nt}

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.960
Yuuki Rito! You again!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.960
I'm sorry! {must be hard running with a hardon... -nt}

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.880
Wait!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.180
Prepare to be punished!

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:28.350
Where did he go? Jeez...

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.770
Let's look over there.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.560
Yes!{added this -masat}

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:36.020
What is this... I can't even go to class like this. {TLC}{your table will lift up}

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.230
Rito! What are you doing in a place like that?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:40.940
Lala!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.030
School uniform mode!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:45.570
Eh?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:50.240
That's for the maintenance of my inventions: Invisible Scope-kun. {TLC}

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.580
Why are you wearing it?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.790
Maintenance?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:57.380
Yes. I made it to see inside my machines. {TLC}

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.670
So that's what this thing is for...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.130
Anyway, how do you take them off?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.090
Oh that? There's a little hook back here.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.590
I'm saved!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:10.930
If it carried on like this, it would lead to more problems!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.140
Rito-kun! I chose these glasses for you.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.270
The ones you're wearing are so out of fashion. Wear mine!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:17.940
Run-chan!

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.520
Lala.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.860
Hey, put these on!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.480
Cover up your front! {TLC}

